---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms & conditions"
  seoTitle="Terms & Conditions | Paradise Travels"
  description="Booking terms and conditions for travel services arranged by Paradise Travels (Pvt) Ltd, Colombo — quotes, confirmations, payments and responsibilities."
  path="/terms"
  updated={new Date('2026-10-22')}
  draft
>
  <p>
    Every trip we arrange is quoted individually, so the booking terms for your trip — what the price includes, how long
    the quote is valid, payment amounts and dates, changes, and the conditions of the hotels, airlines and other
    suppliers involved — are set out in your written quote before you pay anything.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please read your quote carefully and ask us about anything that is unclear. We recommend travel insurance for every
    trip. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or WhatsApp {SITE.phone}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
